ForkSight
==========

Third-party notices for the local chess insights runtime.

python-chess
------------
Used for PGN parsing, board replay, FEN, castling, piece maps, and Syzygy
probing. Distributed under the GNU GPL v3+ with an additional linking
exception permitting use from this application. See
https://github.com/niklasf/python-chess

chessground
-----------
Board widget, GPL-3.0 or later, loaded at runtime from a CDN or a local
copy. Source: https://github.com/lichess-org/chessground
This project does not bundle or link chessground into a binary.

Stockfish
---------
Official Stockfish is GPL-3.0. The user downloads the binary separately
and ForkSight runs it as a child process over UCI. It is neither linked
nor bundled. Source: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish

DuckDB
------
Embedded analytical database, MIT. https://duckdb.org

Lichess
-------
Accuracy formulas and the phase Divider are reimplemented from published
description. Lichess is credited; lila source is AGPL and is not copied.
https://lichess.org/page/accuracy
Population cubes, when present, are derived from the Lichess open database
and credited in data/README.md.
